{"title":"Silver Spear","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Weapon Smithing Lv 26) · Monster drop: Ogre Charger, Hill Giant Adolescent, Orc Berserker, Brask The Mole, Bandit</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 15 · STR 45 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>Skill needed</h2><p>Wielding it takes the <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\"><b>Spear</b> weapon skill</a>. No class starts with it. To learn it, finish the quest <b><a href=\"#/guide/quest-warrior-spear-beyond-the-point\">Beyond the Point</a></b> (Guard Tobin Reed near Underleaf, warriors, level 10): free, and you keep the skill for good.</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\">Weapon skills &amp; specials</a> for how the skill levels and what it unlocks.</p>\n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Weapon Smithing at level 26 <span class=\"muted\">(872 XP)</span> from 5× <a href=\"#/item/silver-bar\">Silver Bar</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"brigand\" title=\"Brask The Mole - dropped it in 1 of 9 looted corpses (1/9)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/219b427558814faec045.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Brask The Mole</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/9<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"orc-berserker\" title=\"Orc Berserker - dropped it in 1 of 20 looted corpses (1/20)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/fd2890ecfdd2a50fb876.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Orc Berserker</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/20<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"hill-giant-adolescent\" title=\"Hill Giant Adolescent - dropped it in 1 of 30 looted corpses (1/30)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9beef5a6d257406a5827.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Hill Giant Adolescent</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/30<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"bandit\" title=\"Bandit - dropped it in 1 of 131 looted corpses (1/131)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/0d647be846757b58c574.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bandit</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/131<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - dropped it in 1 of 839 looted corpses (1/839)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/839<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"silver-spear\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/weapon-smithing\">Weapon smithing</a></p>\n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/silver-spear\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/silver-spear?q=inferior\">Inferior <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/silver-spear?q=crude\">Crude</a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/silver-spear?q=shoddy\">Shoddy <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/silver-spear?q=ordinary\">Ordinary <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/silver-spear?q=good\">Good <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/silver-spear?q=excellent\">Excellent</a><a class=\"q-chip on q-superior\" href=\"#/item/silver-spear?q=superior\">Superior <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/silver-spear?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"silver-spear\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip on\" data-wench=\"\">No enchant</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"destruction\">Destruction</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"burn\">Flame</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"freeze\">Freezing</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"shock\">Storm</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"corrode\">Corrosion</button></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Quality scales this item’s own stats. Damage below is the weapon alone, before your stats and enchantments.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\" id=\"gearQTable\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Quality</th><th>Stats</th><th>This item</th><th>vs Ordinary</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"gearQRows\"><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-spear?q=inferior\" title=\"Show it at Inferior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-inferior\" src=\"data/img/b463ce049563b7e0bed6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></td><td>-30%</td><td>1.3–16.1 damage</td><td>-3.7 avg</td><td class=\"muted\">1 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-spear?q=crude\" title=\"Show it at Crude\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-crude\" src=\"data/img/b463ce049563b7e0bed6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></td><td>-20%</td><td>1.5–18.4 damage</td><td>-2.5 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-spear?q=shoddy\" title=\"Show it at Shoddy\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-shoddy\" src=\"data/img/b463ce049563b7e0bed6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span></td><td>-10%</td><td>1.7–20.7 damage</td><td>-1.2 avg</td><td class=\"muted\">1 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-spear?q=ordinary\" title=\"Show it at Ordinary\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/b463ce049563b7e0bed6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span></td><td>0%</td><td>1.9–23 damage</td><td>0 avg</td><td class=\"muted\">1 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-spear?q=good\" title=\"Show it at Good\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-good\" src=\"data/img/b463ce049563b7e0bed6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-good\">Good</span></td><td>+10%</td><td>2.1–25.3 damage</td><td>+1.2 avg</td><td class=\"muted\">1 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-spear?q=excellent\" title=\"Show it at Excellent\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-excellent\" src=\"data/img/b463ce049563b7e0bed6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">Excellent</span></td><td>+22%</td><td>2.3–28.1 damage</td><td>+2.7 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-spear?q=superior\" title=\"Show it at Superior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-superior\" src=\"data/img/b463ce049563b7e0bed6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">Superior</span></td><td>+30%</td><td>2.5–29.9 damage</td><td>+3.7 avg</td><td class=\"muted\">1 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-spear?q=flawless\" title=\"Show it at Flawless\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-flawless\" src=\"data/img/b463ce049563b7e0bed6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">Flawless</span></td><td>+38%</td><td>2.6–31.7 damage</td><td>+4.7 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <h2>Getting Superior ones</h2>\n      <p><b>Crafting</b> (Weapon Smithing 26): the higher above 26 you are, the better the odds, up to +30. <a href=\"#/calc-quality\" data-qe=\"silver-spear\">Plan it on Quality &amp; enchanting</a></p>\n        <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table\"><thead><tr><th>Your level</th><th><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-good\">Good</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">Excellent</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">Superior</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">Flawless</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>26 <span class=\"muted\">(+0)</span></td><td>1.5%</td><td>4.0%</td><td>19.1%</td><td>56.2%</td><td>16.2%</td><td>2.9%</td><td>0.2%</td><td>~0%</td></tr><tr><td>31 <span class=\"muted\">(+5)</span></td><td>0.5%</td><td>2.4%</td><td>14.2%</td><td>55.7%</td><td>21.4%</td><td>5.1%</td><td>0.7%</td><td>~0%</td></tr><tr><td>36 <span class=\"muted\">(+10)</span></td><td>0.1%</td><td>1.2%</td><td>10.0%</td><td>52.7%</td><td>26.4%</td><td>7.8%</td><td>1.7%</td><td>~0%</td></tr><tr><td>41 <span class=\"muted\">(+15)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.4%</td><td>6.6%</td><td>47.5%</td><td>30.8%</td><td>11.1%</td><td>3.5%</td><td>0.1%</td></tr><tr><td>46 <span class=\"muted\">(+20)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.1%</td><td>3.9%</td><td>40.8%</td><td>33.7%</td><td>15.1%</td><td>5.9%</td><td>0.6%</td></tr><tr><td>49 <span class=\"muted\">(+23)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.0%</td><td>2.8%</td><td>36.3%</td><td>34.5%</td><td>17.5%</td><td>7.8%</td><td>1.2%</td></tr><tr><td>51 <span class=\"muted\">(+25)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.0%</td><td>2.0%</td><td>33.3%</td><td>35.0%</td><td>19.1%</td><td>9.0%</td><td>1.6%</td></tr><tr><td>56 <span class=\"muted\">(+30)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.8%</td><td>25.7%</td><td>34.7%</td><td>22.7%</td><td>12.8%</td><td>3.3%</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      <p><b>Monster drops</b>: ordinary monster